      "claim": "The narrowest dimension of the adult female birth canal (the obstetric conjugate) is about 110 mm.",
      "evidence": "Obstetrics textbooks (e.g., Cunningham et al., 2014) give a normal obstetric conjugate of roughly 10–11 cm.",
      "weight": 0.25,
